    "body": "Problem:  Completion for -complete=breakpoint/filetypecmd uses stale\n          state from a previous :breakdel/:profdel/:filetype completion.\nSolution: Reset the state in set_cmd_context() and getcompletion().\n\ncloses: vim/vim#21419\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/f81f03d457b3a296ce37629411cce3765837a793\n\n",
